---
title: "Quick Access Toolbar"
enterprise: true
---

The Toolbar appears above the grid and provides quick access to common grid actions. It supports custom components with configurable ordering and alignment.

Configure the Toolbar with the `toolbar` grid option. The property takes a list of Toolbar Items.

```{% frameworkTransform=true %}
const gridOptions = {
    toolbar: {
        items: [
            { toolbarItem: CustomToolbarItem },
            { toolbarItem: AnotherToolbarItem, align: 'right' }
        ]
    }
}
```

{% gridExampleRunner title="Toolbar" name="toolbar-simple" /%}

## Configuration

Items are rendered in the order they are defined.

The `align` property can be `left` (default) or `right`.

The `key` uniquely identifies a Toolbar Item.

Additional props are passed to Toolbar Items using `toolbarItemParams`.

```{% frameworkTransform=true %}
const gridOptions = {
    toolbar: {
        items: [
            {
                key: 'myItem',
                toolbarItem: CustomToolbarItem,
                align: 'left',
                toolbarItemParams: {
                    label: 'Custom Label'
                }
            }
        ]
    }
}
```

## Custom Components

Custom Toolbar Item components implement the `IToolbarItemComp` interface.

